  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Human Rights, Rule of Law &amp; Peace Building in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An integrated project focused on the protection of human rights, strengthening of rule of law and peace building processes in Ethiopia. Follow-up support to Justice for All - Prison Fellowship Ethiopia on human rights, training of justice sector officials and efforts to improve justice service delivery as well as internal capacity building of JFA-PFE.</narrative>
  </description>
